    "hideres. Take here hidres in Dict., and add: I. local :-- Hé þǽr lange hyderes and þyderes sécende fór, Hml. S. 236, 730. II. figurative :-- Sió ábisgung hine scofett hidres ðædres, Past. 169, 13. Mé þincþ þ-bar; þú mé dwelige and dyderie and lǽdst mé hidres and þidres, Bt. 35, 5 ; F. 164, 13. Hidres þidres, 36, 5; F. 150, 12."
